      <p class="qsub">Two berry gummies. 180mg magnesium, the real dose on the front. Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue. All dose. No drama.</p>
      <p class="opd">From <b>{{ pd3 | money }} a day</b> · one-off orders, no subscription</p>
