    <p class="fine">Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue.</p>
    <div class="octa"><a class="btn" href="#buy">Reserve mine</a><span>Nothing to pay today · Finish your first jar. Not for you? We&#39;ll refund it.</span></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ogap"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="kick">The food gap</p>
    <h2>It&#39;s not just you. It&#39;s the food.</h2>
    <p>In the UK&#39;s own national diet survey, 15% of women aged 19&ndash;64 don&#39;t reach even the minimum magnesium intake from food alone. Busy days, skipped lunches, one more coffee instead of a meal &mdash; it adds up quietly.</p>
