    <p class="claim">Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue.</p>
    <div class="octa"><a class="btn" href="#buy">Reserve mine</a><span>Nothing to pay today · Finish your first jar. Not for you? We&#39;ll refund it.</span></div>
    <p class="src">Source: National Diet and Nutrition Survey 2019&ndash;2023, Office for Health Improvement and Disparities &amp; Food Standards Agency (2025). Women aged 19&ndash;64 with magnesium intakes from food below the Lower Reference Nutrient Intake.</p>
  </div></section>
