        <tr><th scope="row">Subscription</th><td class="us"><span class="cv"><span class="ic y" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg></span><span>Never. Every order is one-off</span></span></td><td><span class="cv"><span class="ic n" aria-hidden="true">–</span><span>Often hard to cancel</span></span></td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Taste</th><td class="us"><span class="cv"><span class="ic y" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg></span><span>Soft berry gummy</span></span></td><td><span class="cv"><span class="ic n" aria-hidden="true">–</span><span>Large tablets or capsules</span></span></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </div>  <div class="octa"><a class="btn" href="#buy">Reserve mine</a><span>Nothing to pay today · Finish your first jar. Not for you? We&#39;ll refund it.</span></div>
</section>

  <section class="faq" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="side"><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Email {{ section.settings.contact_email }} and a real person replies. Not a bot, promise.</p></div>
    <div>
      <details><summary>What&#39;s in each jar?</summary><p>{{ n | times: 2 }} berry gummies with 90mg magnesium each. One jar lasts {{ n }} days at two gummies a day.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How many gummies do I take?</summary><p>{{ section.settings.dose_text }} Do not exceed the recommended daily intake.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What do they taste like?</summary><p>Ripe red berry. Soft, chewy and glossy, never chalky. Honestly, you&#39;ll look forward to it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long until I notice a difference?</summary><p>Real talk: everyone&#39;s different, so we won&#39;t promise results. Give it a full jar ({{ n }} days) as part of your daily routine. If it isn&#39;t for you, our {{ section.settings.guarantee_days }}-day guarantee has you covered.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I take it alongside HRT or other medication?</summary><p>Please check with your GP or pharmacist before taking any supplement alongside medication.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to subscribe?</summary><p>No. Every order is a one-off purchase. Nothing renews automatically.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How fast is delivery?</summary><p>Royal Mail Tracked, usually 2 to 3 working days. Free on 2 or more jars, {{ section.settings.single_delivery }} for one jar.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if it isn&#39;t for me?</summary><p>Email us within {{ section.settings.guarantee_days }} days of your first order arriving and we&#39;ll refund the jar you opened. No need to send it back. Bought 2 or 3 jars? Post the unopened ones back and we&#39;ll refund those too. One guarantee per customer and household. <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/refunds">Full terms</a>.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="close"><div class="wrap"><div class="box">
    <div class="txt"><h2>Go on. Do one thing for you.</h2><p>Two berry gummies a day, made for this chapter of your life. Backed by our {{ section.settings.guarantee_days }}-day guarantee.</p><a class="btn" href="#buy">Choose your pack</a></div>
    <div class="cimg"><div class="photo">{%- if section.settings.jar_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.jar_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.jar_image.alt, loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}</div><ul class="cfeat"><li class="ck">UK-authorised claims only</li><li class="ck">Two gummies a day, no water</li><li class="ck">Vegan and gelatine-free</li><li class="ck">Free UK delivery on 2+ jars</li><li class="ck">{{ section.settings.guarantee_days }}-day guarantee</li></ul></div>
  </div></div></section>
  <div class="sbar"><div><b>{{ v2.price | money }}</b><small>2 jars · free UK delivery</small></div><a class="btn" href="#buy">Choose your pack</a></div>
</div>
<style>
.mv5 .opd{margin:-4px 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}.mv5 .opd b{color:var(--plum);font-weight:800}
.mv5 .octa{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:center;margin-top:clamp(26px,4vw,40px)}
.mv5 .octa span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);max-width:460px}
.mv5 .otl{background:#fbf7f4;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,88px) 0;text-align:center}
.mv5 .otl h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:6px 0 clamp(22px,3vw,34px)}
.mv5 .otl ol{list-style:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;max-width:1080px;text-align:left}
.mv5 .otl li{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:20px 18px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(61,15,39,.07)}
.mv5 .otl li span{display:inline-block;background:var(--plum,#3d0f27);color:#ffd84d;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.mv5 .otl li b{display:block;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--plum,#3d0f27);margin:10px 0 4px}
.mv5 .otl li p{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}
.mv5 .otl .fine{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}
@media (max-width:860px){.mv5 .otl ol{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mv5 .octa .btn{width:100%}}
@media (max-width:480px){.mv5 .otl ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<style>
.mv5 .ogap{background:#f6e6dc;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,88px) 0;text-align:center}
.mv5 .ogap .wrap{max-width:720px}
.mv5 .ogap h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:6px 0 16px}
.mv5 .ogap p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 14px}
